Hi {Owner},

I build websites for wedding photographers around {City}. {Business Name} has beautiful wedding work, but the site doesn't let a couple check their date or see a starting price before they enquire.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: a date check, packages with starting prices, a coverage-hours timeline, a family formals form and galleries by venue, with marked placeholders where your photos would go. I never use a photographer's work without written permission:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting, new galleries and price changes. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth fifteen minutes on a weekday?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
